    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote": [
      {
        "@value": "SCPG is used to record the general information about static cone penetration tests.\nPressuremeter tests using CPT equipment (e.g. cone or driven pressuremeter) shall be recorded in the PMTG and associated groups.\nSCPG_FILT and SCPG_FRIC are included as they are reporting requirements of BS1377 and BS EN ISO 22476-1.\nSCPG_WATA is required to clarify origin of water level recorded in SCPG_WAT.\nSCPG_REM is used to transfer comments on the test and any interpreted parameters. SCPG_REM may refer to the STND group where full information on standards and references could be provided.\nCPT testing is frequently carried out by specialist sub-contractors. SCPG_CONT is included to record name of specialist sub-contractor.\nSCPG_CAR and SCPG_SLAR are included to transfer information used to calculate qt and ft.",
        "@language": "en"
      }
    ],
